      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      136.53,
      350.17,
      464.75,
      361.24
    ],
    "text": "Declaring a Period of Time for Firearms without Licence to be Handover",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      374.17,
      546.25,
      433.24
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 30 of the Firearms Ordinance, as amended by Ordinances No. 01 of1920, No. 12 of 1945, No. 07 of 1947 and Acts No. 18 and 22 of 1955, No. 38 of 1975, No. 08 of 1980, No. 50 of 1981and No. 22 of 1996 (Chapter 182), I, Maithripala Sirisena, Minister of Defence do hereby declare a period of time asmentioned in the following Schedule to be enforced islandwide for firearms without licence to be handedover to thegovernment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      446.17,
      546.26,
      493.24
    ],
    "text": "Further, when firearms without licence are handedover within the declared period of time, it is ordered that theperson handing over the firearm should not be fined or punished for an offence committed contrary to Section 22 of theFirearms Ordinance with regard to keeping in custody, possession or utilization of the firearm before the date of handover.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      444.69,
      518.17,
      536.59,
      541.24
    ],
    "text": "MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA,Minister of Defence.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
